## Dependency Notice

This project calls [FFmpeg](https://ffmpeg.org/) as a subprocess. FFmpeg is
not distributed with this software — it is installed separately inside the
Docker container via the Alpine package manager.

The Alpine FFmpeg build enables GPL-licensed components. Users deploying this
project are responsible for compliance with FFmpeg's license terms in their
own deployment context. See https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html for details.

This project's MIT license applies solely to the Node.js wrapper code in this
repository and does not extend to FFmpeg or any other dependency.
